b35d8b40fd6b80","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"어디 자세히 한번 말해 봐","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["4969041587139426366"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9964d56b9d809c1721b6","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"난 떳떳해, 안 무서워","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["15228319202272754711"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7469-94299490337f909bb141","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"난 떳떳하니 두려울 게 없어","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14808194635780386534"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a1c265a4e77a7ff42509","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"넌 실연당한 드로마스를 몰래 따라가서, 방심한 틈을 타 함께 사진을 찍었어. 현인은 사랑에 빠지지 않는다는 셀카를 남긴 거지","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["17848397271238230017"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cb43834b43b4469f3208","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"넌 길가의 점쟁이한테 점을 보고, 노점 앞에서 내 운명은 내가 만든다는 셀카를 남겼어","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["6103124144229459854"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-86915e5964ebe235c808","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"넌 산책을 나갔다가 우연히 음유시인을 만났고… 그 자리에서 랩을 선보이고는 셀카 한 장을 남겼지","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["11527983669537879527"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-24613758aba2eeffc00d","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"넌 아침에 머리가 헝클어진 채로 셀카를 한 장 찍었어","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["12838373609157940967"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-68a30835f9bfecffc7ca","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"요즘 살이 좀 찐 것 같아서 넌 셀카를 한 장 찍었어","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["8469728385138888941"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-969d5a9711613345c349","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"그, 그만","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["9801876057617824777"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bce811456f8c7395190b","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"그만, 우리한테 「망각」의 힘이 좀 필요하겠네","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["3987846396755030131"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-641e0ae40904a9aff02a","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"그건 다 Mar. 7th를 위해서였어","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["3779647428975429875"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7469-642cfd1fd2ac5f5853ad","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"하아, 조용히 하려 했는데 들켜 버렸네","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["7906434711130867432"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7469-49b376559c4c14da526f","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","text":"그건 다 Mar. 7th를 위해 찍은 사진이야","speaker":"","mission":"Mar. 7th","scene":"메시지 19","typ